{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31426","headline":"题嘉祥驿 · 卢渥","name":"题嘉祥驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"交亲荣饯洛城空，秉钺戎装上将同。\n星使自天丹诏下，雕鞍照地数程中。\n马嘶静谷声偏响，斾映晴山色更红。\n到後定知人易化，满街棠树有遗风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢渥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}